#. i18n: file: ksnapshotwidget.ui:105
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbIncludeDecorations)
#: rc.cpp:32
msgid ""
"When enabled, snapshot of a window will also include the window decorations"
msgstr ""
"Tchoezixhoz çouchal si vos vloz eto les gåliotaedjes do purnea (båre di "
"tite, boirdeures) dins l' waitroûlêye"

#. i18n: file: ksnapshotwidget.ui:108
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbIncludeDecorations)
#: rc.cpp:35
